<Base title="Affiliate & sponsor disclosure" description="How this directory makes money and how paid placements are labeled." crumbs={[['Home', '/'], ['Disclosure', '/disclosure/']]}>
<div class="wrap page-head prose"><h1>Affiliate & sponsor disclosure</h1>
<p>This site may earn money from (1) featured listings and sponsorships bought by software vendors, and (2) affiliate links to hosted plans or hosting providers. Paid placements are always labeled "Featured" or "Sponsored". Payment never changes a tool's license, star count, activity data, or whether it is listed.</p>
<h2>Where the data comes from</h2><p>Listing facts come from the public GitHub REST API, with the source URL and fetch date shown on every tool page. Logos are each project owner's GitHub avatar. Category and "replaces" labels are our editorial classification.</p></div>
</Base>
